hadiths[37]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1500","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Yahud Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aae aur Aap se zikr kya ke un mein se mard aur aurat ne zina kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya ke tum Taurat mein rajm ke muamle mein kya pate ho. To unhon ne kaha ke hum inhein ruswa karte hain aur kode marte hain. To Salam ke bete Abdullah ne kaha ke tum ne jhoot bola, is mein rajm hai. To Taurat lae aur use phailaya to un mein se aik ne rajm ki aayat par apna haath rakha phir is se pehle aur is ke baad padha, to Salam ke bete Abdullah ne us se kaha ke apna haath uthao, to us ne apna haath uthaya to us mein rajm ki aayat thi, to unhon ne kaha ke aye Muhammad tum ne sach kaha, is mein rajm ki aayat hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un dono ka hukm diya aur wo dono rajm kiye gae. To Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke maine mard ko dekha ke wo aurat par jhukta tha aur use patharon se bachata tha."
"1501","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Aslam mein se aik mard Siddiq ke bete Abu Bakr ke paas aaya aur un se kaha ke dusre ne zina kya hai. To Abu Bakr ne us se kaha ke kya tum ne ye mere ilawa kisi se zikr kya. To us ne kaha ke nahi. To Abu Bakr ne kaha ke Allah se tauba karo aur Allah ke parde se parda karo kyunke Allah apne bandon se tauba qubool karta hai. To us ka nafs use qaraar na de saka yahan tak ke Umar bin Khattab ke paas aaya aur un se waisa kaha jaisa Abu Bakr se kaha tha, to Umar ne us se waisa kaha jaisa Abu Bakr ne us se kaha tha, to us ka nafs use qaraar na de saka yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se kaha ke dusre ne zina kya hai. Saeed ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se teen martaba munh phera, har martaba Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us se munh pherte, yahan tak ke jab us ne zyada kya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us ke ghar walon ki taraf bheja aur farmaya ke kya wo shikayat karta hai ya is mein deewangi hai. To unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah Allah ki qasam ye to tandrust hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kunwara ya shadi shuda. To unhon ne kaha ke balke shadi shuda ya Rasulullah. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us ka hukm diya aur wo rajm kya gaya."
"1502","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe khabar pahunchi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Aslam mein se Hazal naami mard se farmaya ke aye Hazal agar tum use apni chadar se dhanpte to tumhare liye behtar hota. Yahya bin Saeed ne kaha ke maine ye hadis aisi majlis mein bayan ki jis mein Hazal Aslami ke bete Nuaim ke bete Yazeed they to Yazeed ne kaha ke Hazal mere dada hain aur ye hadis haq hai."
"1503","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke aik mard ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein apne upar zina ka iqrar kya aur apne upar chaar martaba gawahi di to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us ka hukm diya aur wo rajm kya gaya. Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab ne kaha ke is liye mard ko us ke apne upar iqrar se pakda jata hai."
"1504","Mujhe Malik ne Talha ke bete Zaid ke bete Yaqoob se, unhon ne apne walid Talha ke bete Zaid se, unhon ne Mulaika ke bete Abi Mulaika ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke aik aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aayi aur Aap ko khabar di ke us ne zina kya hai jabke wo haamila hai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke jao yahan tak ke bacha jano. Phir jab us ne bacha jana to Aap ke paas aayi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke jao yahan tak ke use doodh pilao. Phir jab us ne use doodh pilaya to Aap ke paas aayi to Aap ne farmaya ke jao aur use amanat rakho. Unhon ne kaha ke us ne use amanat rakha phir aayi to us ka hukm diya gaya aur wo rajm ki gayi."
"1505","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Masud ke bete Utba ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ubaidullah se, unhon ne Abu Huraira aur Juhani Khalid ke bete Zaid se riwayat kya ke un dono ne unhein khabar di ke do mard Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jhagda lekar aae to in dono mein se aik ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah hamare darmiyan Allah ki kitab se faisla karein, aur dusre ne kaha jabke wo in dono mein zyada faqeeh tha ke haan ya Rasulullah hamare darmiyan Allah ki kitab se faisla karein aur mujhe ijazat dein ke bolun. Aap ne farmaya ke bolo. To us ne kaha ke mera beta is ka mazdoor tha aur us ne us ki biwi se zina kya to mujhe khabar di gayi ke mere bete par rajm hai to maine is se sau bakriyan aur meri londi se fidya diya, phir maine ahl-e-ilm se pucha to unhon ne mujhe khabar di ke mere bete par to sau kode aur saal bhar jalawatni hai aur unhon ne mujhe khabar di ke rajm to us ki biwi par hai. To Rasulullah ne farmaya ke raha main, us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai main tum dono ke darmiyan Allah ki kitab se faisla karunga, rahi tumhari bakriyan aur tumhari londi to tum par lauti hui hain. Aur us ke bete ko sau kode mare aur use saal bhar jalawatan kya aur Aslami Unais ko hukm diya ke dusre ki biwi ke paas jae, phir agar wo iqrar kare to use rajm kare, to us ne iqrar kya aur wo rajm ki gayi."
"1506","Mujhe Malik ne Saleh ke bete Abi Saleh ke bete Suhail se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Ubada ke bete Saad ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke batao agar main apni biwi ke sath mard paun to kya use mohlat dun yahan tak ke chaar gawah lekar aaun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan."
"1507","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Masud ke bete Utba ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ubaidullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Umar bin Khattab ko kehte suna ke Allah ki kitab mein rajm haq hai us par jo mardon aur auraton mein se zina kare jab muhsin ho, jab gawahi qaim ho ya hamal ho ya iqrar ho."
"1508","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se, unhon ne Laithi Abu Waqid se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ke paas mard aaya jabke wo Sham mein they to un se zikr kya ke us ne apni biwi ke sath mard paya hai, to Umar bin Khattab ne Laithi Abu Waqid ko us ki biwi ke paas bheja taake is ke bare mein us se puche, to us ke paas aaya jabke us ke gird auratein thin, to us se jo us ke shohar ne Umar bin Khattab se kaha tha zikr kya aur use khabar di ke wo us ke qaul se na pakdi jaegi, aur use is jaisa sikhane laga taake wapas le, to us ne wapas lene se inkar kya aur iqrar par qaim rahi, to Umar ne us ka hukm diya aur wo rajm ki gayi."
"1509","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein kehte suna ke jab Umar bin Khattab Mina se laute to Abطح mein oont bithaya phir patharilon ka dher lagaya phir us par apni chadar dali aur seedhe lete phir apne dono haath aasman ki taraf phailae aur kaha ke aye Allah meri umr badi ho gayi aur meri quwwat kamzor ho gayi aur meri raaya phail gayi. To mujhe apne paas qaba kar le baghair zae kiye aur na zyadati karte hue. Phir Madina aae aur logon ko khutba diya aur kaha ke aye logon tumhare liye sunnatein sunnat ki gain aur tumhare liye faraiz farz kiye gae aur tumhein wazeh par chhora gaya siwae is ke ke tum logon se daein baein gumrah ho, aur apne aik haath se dusre par mara phir kaha ke rajm ki aayat se halaak hone se bacho ke kehne wala kahe ke hum Allah ki kitab mein do haddein nahi pate, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rajm kya aur hum ne rajm kya, us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai agar log ye na kahenge ke Umar bin Khattab ne Allah Taala ki kitab mein zyada kya. To main use likhta ke budha mard aur budhi aurat to in dono ko albatta rajm karo. Hum ne use padha hai. Malik ne kaha ke Yahya bin Saeed ne kaha ke Saeed bin Musayyab ne kaha ke Zul Hijja juda na hua yahan tak ke Umar qatal kiye gae, Allah un par rehem kare. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke un ka qaul ke budha mard aur budhi aurat yani shadi shuda mard aur shadi shuda aurat to in dono ko albatta rajm karo. Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se us ke bare mein pucha jo Loot ki qoum ka amal kare. To Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab ne kaha ke us par rajm hai, muhsin ho ya muhsin na ho."
"1510","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Affan ke bete Usman ke paas aurat laayi gayi jo chhe mahine mein bacha jani thi to us ka hukm diya ke rajm ki jae, to Talib ke bete Ali bin Abi Talib ne kaha ke ye us par nahi, Allah Tabarak wa Taala apni kitab mein kehte hain ke us ka hamal aur us ka doodh chhurana tees mahine hai, aur farmaya ke maaein apne bachon ko doodh pilati hain do saal mukammal jo doodh poora karna chahe, to hamal chhe mahine hota hai to us par rajm nahi. To Affan ke bete Usman ne us ke peechhe bheja aur use paya ke wo rajm ki ja chuki thi."
"1511","Mujhe Malik ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke aik mard ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein apne upar zina ka iqrar kya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us ke liye koda mangwaya aur toota hua koda laya gaya to Aap ne farmaya ke is se upar. To naya koda laya gaya jis ka phal na kata gaya tha to Aap ne farmaya ke is se kam. To aisa koda laya gaya jis par sawari ki gayi thi aur narm ho gaya tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us ka hukm diya aur wo koda mara gaya phir farmaya ke aye logon tumhare liye waqt aagaya hai ke Allah ki hudood se ruko, jo in gandagiyon mein se koi cheez pae wo Allah ke parde se parda kare kyunke jo hum par apna safha zahir karega hum us par Allah ki kitab qaim kareinge."
"1512","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Ubaid ki beti Safiya bint Abi Ubaid ne unhein khabar di ke Siddiq ke bete Abu Bakr ke paas mard laya gaya jo kunwari londi par pada tha aur use haamila kar diya tha phir us ne apne upar zina ka iqrar kya jabke wo muhsin na tha, to Abu Bakr ne us ka hukm diya aur wo hadd koda mara gaya phir Fadak ki taraf jalawatan kya gaya."
"1513","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Masud ke bete Utba ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ubaidullah se, unhon ne Abu Huraira aur Juhani Khalid ke bete Zaid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se londi ke bare mein pucha gaya jab wo zina kare aur muhsin na hui ho. To Aap ne farmaya ke agar zina kare to use kode maro phir agar zina kare to use kode maro phir agar zina kare to use kode maro phir use becho agarche rassi se. Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab ne kaha ke main nahi janta ke teesri ke baad ya chauthi ke baad."
"1514","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke khums ke ghulamon par qaim rehne wala ghulam tha aur us ne us ghulamon mein se londi se zabardasti ki aur is se sohbat ki to Umar bin Khattab ne use koda mara aur jalawatan kya aur londi ko koda na mara kyunke us ne is se zabardasti ki thi."
"1515","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Yasar ke bete Sulaiman ne unhein khabar di ke Rabi ke bete Abi Rabi ke bete Abdullah bin Ayyash ne kaha ke Umar bin Khattab ne mujhe Quraish ke jawanon mein hukm diya aur hum ne hukumat ki londiyon mein se londiyon ko zina mein pachaas pachaas kode mare."
"1516","Mujhe Malik ne Abu Zinad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne ghulam ko tohmat mein assi kode mare. Abu Zinad ne kaha ke maine Rabi ke bete Aamir ke bete Abdullah se is ke bare mein pucha to unhon ne kaha ke maine Umar bin Khattab aur Affan ke bete Usman aur khalifaon ko pai dar pai paya aur maine kisi ko na dekha ke ghulam ko tohmat mein chalis se zyada kode mare."
"1517","Mujhe Malik ne Aili Hakeem ke bete Zuraiq se riwayat kya ke Misbah naami mard ne apne bete se madad mangi aur goya us ne us mein susti ki, phir jab wo us ke paas aaya to us se kaha ke aye zani. Zuraiq ne kaha ke us ne mujh se us par madad mangi, phir jab maine use koda marna chaha to us ke bete ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam agar tum ne use koda mara to main apne upar zina ka iqrar karunga. Phir jab us ne ye kaha to muamla mujh par mushkil ho gaya to maine is mein Umar bin Abdul Aziz ko likha jabke wo us din wali they, un se is ka zikr kya, to Umar ne mujhe likha ke us ka muaf karna nafiz karo. Zuraiq ne kaha ke maine Umar bin Abdul Aziz ko ye bhi likha ke batao mard jis par ya us ke maan baap par tohmat lagai gayi jabke wo halaak ho gae hon ya in dono mein se aik. Unhon ne kaha ke Umar ne mujhe likha ke agar wo muaf kare to us ka apne nafs mein muaf karna nafiz karo, aur agar us ke maan baap par tohmat lagai gayi jabke wo halaak ho gae hon ya in dono mein se aik to us ke liye Allah ki kitab se lo magar ke wo parda chahen. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke is ki wajah ye hai ke wo mard jis par tohmat lagai gayi dare ke agar wo is se parda uthae to us par gawahi qaim ho, phir jab wo jo maine bayan kya us par ho aur wo muaf kare to us ka muaf karna jaiz hai."
"1518","Mujhe Malik ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo qoum ki jamaat ko dhamki de ke us par aik hadd ke siwa kuchh nahi. Malik ne kaha ke agar wo juda hon to us par aik hadd ke siwa kuchh nahi. Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Harisa Numan ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Muhammad Abu Rijal se, unhon ne apni walida Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ke zamane mein do mard ne aapas mein gali di to in dono mein se aik ne dusre se kaha ke Allah ki qasam na mera baap zani hai aur na meri maan zaniya hai. To is mein Umar bin Khattab se mashwara kya gaya to kehne wale ne kaha ke us ne apne maan baap ki tareef ki aur dusron ne kaha ke us ke maan baap ke liye is ke ilawa tareef thi, hum samajhte hain ke use hadd koda maro. To Umar ne use hadd assi kode mare. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hadd nahi magar nafi ya dhamki ya ishara mein jis mein dekha jae ke us ke kehne wale ne is se nafi ya dhamki ka irada kya hai, to jo ye kahe us par mukammal hadd hai. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm hai ke jab mard mard ko us ke baap se nafi kare to us par hadd hai agarche jis ki nafi ki gayi us ki maan mamluka ho to us par hadd hai."
"1519","Mujhe Malik ne Harisa ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Muhammad Abu Rijal se, unhon ne apni walida Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kuwen ke bache hue pani ko na roko."
"1520","Mujhe Malik ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Rabia se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne us mard se kaha jo apni biwi ki londi lekar safar mein nikla aur is se sohbat ki aur us ki biwi ne ghairat khai. To us ne is ka zikr Umar bin Khattab se kya to unhon ne us se is ke bare mein pucha to us ne kaha ke us ne use mujhe bakhsh diya tha. To Umar ne kaha ke tum mere paas gawah lekar aao warna main tumhein patharon se maarunga. Unhon ne kaha ke us ki biwi ne iqrar kya ke us ne use use bakhsh diya tha."
"1521","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dhaal mein haath kaata jis ki qeemat teen dirham thi."
"1522","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Husain Makki ke bete Abi Husain Abdur Rahman ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke latke hue phal mein aur na pahad ki charagah mein haath nahi kaata jaega, phir jab use baada ya khalihan panaah de to haath kaatna us mein hai jo dhaal ki qeemat tak pahunche."
"1523","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se riwayat kya ke chor ne Usman ke zamane mein turanj churaya to Affan ke bete Usman ne us ka hukm diya ke us ki qeemat lagai jae, to us ki qeemat teen dirham lagai gayi barah dirham ke dinar ke sarf se, to Usman ne us ka haath kaata."
"1524","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujh par lamba na hua aur main na bhooli ke haath chauthai dinar aur is se upar mein kaata jaega."
"1525","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hazm ke bete Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha Makka ki taraf niklin jabke un ke sath un ki do azad karda thin aur un ke sath Siddiq ke bete Abi Bakr ke bete Abdullah ke Banu ka ghulam tha, to unhon ne dono azad kardaon ke sath kata hua shawl bheja jis par sabz kapda sila hua tha. Unhon ne kaha ke ghulam ne shawl liya aur use phaad diya aur is mein se nikala aur us ki jagah namda ya posteen rakha aur us par sila, phir jab dono azad kardaein Madina aaein to unhon ne ye us ke ghar walon ko diya, phir jab unhon ne use phaada to is mein namda paya aur shawl na paya, to unhon ne dono auraton se baat ki aur un dono ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se baat ki ya unhein likha aur ghulam par tohmat lagai, to ghulam se is ke bare mein pucha gaya to us ne iqrar kya, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ne us ka hukm diya aur us ka haath kaata gaya, aur Aaisha ne kaha ke haath chauthai dinar aur is se upar mein kaata jaega."
"1526","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Umar ke bete Abdullah bin Umar ka ghulam chori karta tha jabke wo bhaga hua tha, to Abdullah bin Umar ne use Aas ke bete Saeed ke paas bheja jabke wo Madina ke ameer they taake us ka haath kaatein, to Saeed ne us ka haath kaatne se inkar kya aur kaha ke bhage hue chor ghulam ka haath na kaata jaega jab chori kare. To Abdullah bin Umar ne us se kaha ke tum ne Allah ki kis kitab mein ye paya, phir Abdullah bin Umar ne us ka hukm diya aur us ka haath kaata gaya."
"1527","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hakeem ke bete Zuraiq se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne bhaga hua ghulam pakda jo chori karta tha. Unhon ne kaha ke muamla mujh par mushkil hua. Unhon ne kaha ke maine is mein Umar bin Abdul Aziz ko likha aur is ke bare mein us se pucha jabke wo us din wali they. Unhon ne kaha ke maine unhein khabar di ke main sunta tha ke bhaga hua ghulam jab chori kare jabke wo bhaga hua ho to us ka haath na kaata jae. Unhon ne kaha ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne mujhe mere khat ke khilaf likha, kehte hain ke tum ne mujhe likha ke tum sunte they ke bhaga hua ghulam jab chori kare to us ka haath na kaata jae, jabke Allah Tabarak wa Taala apni kitab mein kehte hain ke chor mard aur chor aurat to in dono ke haath kaato, un ke kiye ka badla, Allah ki taraf se ibrat, aur Allah azeez hakeem hai. Phir agar us ki chori chauthai dinar aur is se upar tak pahunche to us ka haath kaato. Aur mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Muhammad ke bete Qasim aur Abdullah ke bete Salim aur Zubair ke bete Urwa kehte they ke jab bhaga hua ghulam wo churaye jo haath kaatne mein wajib hai to haath kaata jae. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek wo hukm jis mein koi ikhtilaf nahi ke bhaga hua ghulam jab wo churaye jo haath kaatne mein wajib hai to haath kaata jae."
"1528","Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke hamare nazdeek us ke bare mein hukm hai jo janwaron mein se koi cheez pae ke jo use pae us par hai jo us ki qeemat mein kami hui. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko us oont ke bare mein kehte suna jo mard par hamla kare aur wo apne nafs par is se dare aur use qatal kare ya zakhmi kare, to agar us ke paas gawahi ho ke us ne us ka irada kya tha aur us par hamla kya tha to us par tawaan nahi, aur agar us ke liye gawahi qaim na ho magar us ka qaul to wo oont ka zamin hai."
"1529","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Safwan ke bete Abdullah ke bete Safwan se riwayat kya ke Umayya ke bete Safwan se kaha gaya ke jo hijrat na kare halaak ho gaya. To Umayya ke bete Safwan Madina aae aur masjid mein soe aur apni chadar takiya banayi, to chor aaya aur us ki chadar le li, to Safwan ne chor ko pakda aur use lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aae to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke kya tum ne is ki chadar churai hai. Unhon ne kaha ke haan. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke us ka haath kaata jae to Safwan ne us se kaha ke maine ye irada na kya tha ya Rasulullah, ye us par sadqa hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum use mere paas lane se pehle kyun na hue."
"1530","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Rabia se riwayat kya ke Awwam ke bete Zubair chor pakde hue mard se mile jo use hukmran ke paas le jana chahta tha, to Zubair ne us ke liye sifarish ki taake use chhor de, to us ne kaha ke nahi yahan tak ke use hukmran tak pahunchaun. To Zubair ne kaha ke jab tum use hukmran tak pahunchao to sifarish karne wale aur jis ke liye sifarish ki gayi dono par Allah ki lanat ho."
"1531","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Qasim ke bete Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Yaman walon mein se aik mard jis ka haath paon kata hua tha aaya aur Siddiq ke bete Abu Bakr ke paas utra aur un se shikayat ki ke Yaman ke aamil ne us par zulm kya hai, to wo raat se namaz padhta tha aur Abu Bakr kehte they ke tumhare baap ki qasam tumhari raat chor ki raat nahi. Phir unhon ne Umais ki beti Asma ka haar jo Siddiq ke bete Abu Bakr ki biwi thin gum paya, to wo mard un ke sath ghoomne laga aur kehta tha ke aye Allah jis ne is saleh ghar walon par raat mein hamla kya us par, to zewar sunar ke paas paya gaya jis ne kaha ke kata hua us ke paas use lekar aaya tha, to kate hue ne is ka iqrar kya ya us par is se gawahi di gayi, to Siddiq ke bete Abu Bakr ne us ka hukm diya aur us ka baein haath kaata gaya, aur Abu Bakr ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam us ka apne upar dua karna mere nazdeek us par us ki chori se zyada sakht hai. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek us ke bare mein hukm hai jo baar baar churaye phir us par dawa kya jae ke us par nahi magar ke us ka haath kaata jae un sab ke liye jin se churaya jab us par hadd qaim na ki gayi ho, phir agar us par is se pehle hadd qaim ki gayi ho phir wo churaye jo haath kaatne mein wajib hai to phir bhi haath kaata jaega."
"1532","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke Zanad ke bete Abu Zinad ne unhein khabar di ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz ke aamil ne dakaiti mein logon ko pakda jabke unhon ne kisi ko qatal na kya tha, to us ne chaha ke un ke haath kaate ya qatal kare, to is mein Umar bin Abdul Aziz ko likha to Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne us ki taraf likha ke agar tum is mein se aasan lo. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke hamare nazdeek us ke bare mein hukm hai jo logon ka saman churaye jo bazaaron mein rakha ho aur hifazat kya gaya ho aur us ke ghar walon ne use apne bartanon mein hifazat kya ho aur baaz ko baaz se milaya ho ke jo is mein se koi cheez churaye us ki hifazat se aur us ki qeemat us tak pahunche jo haath kaatne mein wajib hai to us par haath kaatna hai, chahe saman wala apne saman ke paas ho ya na ho, raat mein ho ya din mein. Malik ne us ke bare mein kaha jo wo churaye jo us par haath kaatne mein wajib hai phir us ke sath jo churaya paya jae aur us ke malik ki taraf lautaya jae ke us ka haath kaata jaega. Malik ne kaha ke phir agar kehne wala kahe ke us ka haath kaise kaata jaega jabke saman us se liya gaya aur us ke malik ko diya gaya, to ye to us ke manzilay mein hai jo sharab piye aur is mein se nashawar sharab ki boo pai jae jabke is mein nasha na ho aur wo hadd koda mara jae. Unhon ne kaha ke nashawar mein hadd to koda mara jaega jab use piye agarche use nasha na ho, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke us ne use is liye piya taake use nasha ho, to isi tarah chor ka haath us chori mein kaata jaega jo us se li gayi agarche wo is se faida na uthae aur wo us ke malik ki taraf lauti, balke us ne use jab churaya is liye churaya taake use le jae. Malik ne us qoum ke bare mein kaha jo ghar mein aaein aur is mein se sab churayein aur bojh lekar niklein jise sab uthate hon ya sandooq ya lakdi ya tokri ya is jaisa jo qoum sab uthae ke jab wo use us ki hifazat se nikalein jabke wo use sab uthate hon aur jo us mein se lekar nikle us ki qeemat us tak pahunche jo haath kaatne mein wajib hai, aur ye teen dirham aur is se upar hai, to un sab par haath kaatna hai. Unhon ne kaha ke agar in mein se har aik alag saman lekar nikle to jo in mein se us se nikle jis ki qeemat teen dirham aur is se upar tak pahunche us par haath kaatna hai aur jo in mein se us se na nikle jis ki qeemat teen dirham tak na pahunche us par haath nahi kaata jaega. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm hai ke jab mard ka ghar us par band ho aur us ke sath is mein us ke ilawa koi na ho to jo is mein se koi cheez churaye us par haath nahi kaata jaega yahan tak ke use tamam ghar se nikale, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke tamam ghar us ki hifazat hai, phir agar us ke sath ghar mein ghair rehne wala ho aur in mein se har insan apna darwaza band karta ho aur wo un sab ke liye hifazat ho to jo un ghar ke gharon mein se koi cheez churaye jo haath kaatne mein wajib hai aur use ghar ki taraf nikale to us ne use us ki hifazat se ghair hifazat ki taraf nikala aur us par is mein haath kaatna wajib hua. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ghulam ke bare mein hukm hai jo apne aaqa ke saman mein se churaye ke agar wo us ki khidmat mein se na ho aur na us mein se ho jo us ke ghar par aman pata ho phir poshida dakhil ho aur apne aaqa ke saman mein se wo churaye jo haath kaatne mein wajib hai to us par haath nahi kaata jaega, aur isi tarah londi jab apne aaqa ke saman mein se churaye to us par haath nahi kaata jaega. Aur us ghulam ke bare mein kaha jo us ki khidmat mein se na ho aur na us mein se ho jo us ke ghar par aman pata ho aur poshida dakhil ho aur apne aaqa ki biwi ke saman mein se wo churaye jo haath kaatne mein wajib hai ke us ka haath kaata jaega. Unhon ne kaha ke isi tarah aurat ki londi jab wo us ki khadima na ho aur na us ke shohar ki aur na us mein se ho jo us ke ghar par aman pati ho aur poshida dakhil ho aur apni malika ke saman mein se wo churaye jo haath kaatne mein wajib hai to us par haath nahi kaata jaega. Malik ne kaha ke isi tarah aurat ki londi jo us ki khidmat mein se na ho aur na us mein se ho jo us ke ghar par aman pati ho aur poshida dakhil ho aur apni malika ke shohar ke saman mein se wo churaye jo haath kaatne mein wajib hai ke us ka haath kaata jaega. Malik ne kaha ke isi tarah mard apni biwi ke saman mein se churaye ya aurat apne shohar ke saman mein se wo churaye jo haath kaatne mein wajib hai, agar jo in dono mein se har aik ne apne sathi ke saman mein se churaya us ghar ke ilawa ghar mein ho jin par wo dono band karte hon aur us ghar ke ilawa hifazat mein ho jismein wo dono hon, to jo in dono mein se apne sathi ke saman mein se wo churaye jo haath kaatne mein wajib hai us par is mein haath kaatna hai. Malik ne chhote bache aur ajami ke bare mein kaha jo faseeh na ho ke jab wo dono apni hifazat ya taale se churaye jaein to jo in dono ko churaye us par haath kaatna hai, aur agar wo dono apni hifazat aur taale se niklein to jo in dono ko churaye us par haath nahi kaata jaega. Unhon ne kaha ke ye dono pahad ki charagah aur latke hue phal ke manzilay mein hain. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek us ke bare mein hukm hai jo qabrein khode ke jab qabr se jo nikala us tak pahunche jo haath kaatne mein wajib hai to us par is mein haath kaatna hai. Aur Malik ne kaha ke is ki wajah ye hai ke qabr us mein jo hai us ki hifazat hai jaisa ghar us mein jo hai us ki hifazat hain. Unhon ne kaha ke us par haath nahi kaata jaega yahan tak ke use qabr se nikale."
"1533","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Habban ke bete Muhammad bin Yahya se riwayat kya ke ghulam ne mard ki deewar se khajoor ka paudha churaya aur use apne aaqa ki deewar mein lagaya, to paudhe wala use talash karte hue nikla aur use paya to us ne Hakam ke bete Marwan se ghulam par madad mangi to Marwan ne ghulam ko qaid kya aur us ka haath kaatna chaha, to ghulam ka aaqa Khudaij ke bete Rafi ke paas gaya aur is ke bare mein us se pucha to us ne unhein khabar di ke us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kehte suna ke phal aur guda mein haath nahi kaata jaega. Aur guda guthli hai. To mard ne kaha ke Hakam ke bete Marwan ne mera ghulam pakda hai jabke wo use kaatna chahta hai aur main chahta hun ke mere sath us ke paas chalo aur use wo khabar do jo tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai. To Rafi us ke sath Hakam ke bete Marwan ke paas gae aur kaha ke tum ne is ka ghulam pakda hai. To us ne kaha ke haan. To us ne kaha ke tum is se kya karne wale ho. Unhon ne kaha ke maine us ka haath kaatna chaha hai. To Rafi ne us se kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kehte suna ke phal aur guda mein haath nahi kaata jaega. To Marwan ne ghulam ka hukm diya aur wo chhor diya gaya."
"1534","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Yazeed ke bete Saib se riwayat kya ke Hadrami ke bete Amr ke bete Abdullah Kh attab ke bete Umar bin Khattab ke paas apna ghulam lekar aae aur un se kaha ke mere is ghulam ka haath kaato kyunke us ne chori ki hai. To Umar ne us se kaha ke us ne kya churaya. To us ne kaha ke us ne meri biwi ke aaine ko churaya jis ki qeemat saath dirham thi. To Umar ne kaha ke use chhor do, us par haath nahi kaata jaega, tumhara khadim tumhara saman chura kar le gaya."
"1535","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Hakam ke bete Marwan ke paas insan laya gaya jo saman ukhad kar le gaya tha to us ne us ka haath kaatna chaha to Sabit ke bete Zaid ki taraf bheja aur is ke bare mein us se pucha to Sabit ke bete Zaid ne kaha ke ukhadne mein haath nahi kaata jaega."
"1536","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Hazm ke bete Amr ke bete Muhammad ke bete Abu Bakr ne khabar di ke unhon ne Nabti ko pakda jo lohe ki anguthiyan chura kar le gaya tha to use qaid kya taake us ka haath kaatein, to Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra ne us ki taraf apni Umayya naami azad karda ko bheja. Abu Bakr ne kaha ke wo mere paas aayi jabke main logon ke darmiyan tha to us ne kaha ke tumhari khala Amra tum se kehti hain ke aye bhanje tum ne Nabti ko mamuli cheez mein pakda hai jiska mujhe zikr kya gaya aur tum ne us ka haath kaatna chaha. Maine kaha ke haan. Unhon ne kaha ke Amra tum se kehti hain ke haath nahi kaata jaega magar chauthai dinar aur is se upar mein. Abu Bakr ne kaha ke maine Nabti ko bhej diya. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ghulamon ke iqrar mein ijma wala hukm hai ke jo un mein se apne upar kisi cheez ka iqrar kare jis mein hadd aur saza us ke jism mein wajeh ho. To us ka iqrar us par jaiz hai aur us par tohmat nahi lagai jaegi ke wo apne upar ye wajeh kare. Malik ne kaha ke jo un mein se us muamle ka iqrar kare jo us ke aaqa par tawaan ho to us ka iqrar us ke aaqa par jaiz nahi. Malik ne kaha ke mazdoor aur mard par jo qoum ke sath hon aur un ki khidmat karte hon jab wo in dono ko churayein haath nahi kaata jaega kyunke in dono ka haal chor ka haal nahi, balke in dono ka haal khain ka haal hai aur khain par haath nahi kaata jaega. Malik ne us ke bare mein kaha jo aariya lekar inkar kare ke us par haath nahi kaata jaega, balke is ki misaal us mard jaisi hai jis ka mard par qarz ho aur wo is ka inkar kare to us par jo inkar kya us mein haath nahi kaata jaega. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek chor ke bare mein ijma wala hukm hai jo ghar mein paya jae jabke us ne saman jama kya ho aur use na nikala ho ke us par haath nahi kaata jaega, balke is ki misaal us mard jaisi hai jo apne samne sharab rakhe taake use piye aur na kare to us par hadd nahi, aur is jaisa hai mard aurat se majlis mein baithe jabke wo use haram pahunchna chahta ho aur na kare aur is se ye na pahunche to us par bhi is mein hadd nahi. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ijma wala hukm hai ke ukhadne mein haath nahi kaata jaega, us ki qeemat us tak pahunche jo haath kaatne mein ho ya na pahunche."
